  "result_text": "`GET /members/{memberId}/loans` is in place. It returns the member's unreturned loans with book titles, paged by `page` and `size`, and `totalCount` covers all active loans regardless of page. `./gradlew build` passes with all 26 tests, including 6 new ones, and the change is committed as `f27401b`.\n\nBehavior:\n- **Response:** `{items: [{loanId, bookId, title, loanedAt, dueAt}], page, size, totalCount}`. Items are ordered by loan date, then loan ID.\n- **Defaults:** `page=0` and `size=20` when the parameters are omitted.\n- **Unknown member:** returns `404`, matching `GET /members/{memberId}`.\n- **Invalid paging:** negative `page` or `size` below 1 returns `400`.\n\nDecisions I made that you may want to change:\n- **No maximum `size`:** a caller can request an arbitrarily large page. I didn't add a cap because the spec doesn't give one. It's a one-line check if you want it.\n- **Left join to books:** a loan whose book row is missing still appears, with `title` set to `null`, rather than disappearing from the list.\n\nFiles are under `application/`, `adapter/` and `src/test/.../MemberLoansApiTest.java`.",
